<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results from the</p>
<p>Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Catalina Cristea (Romania) beat Rene Simpson (Canada) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) beat Laurence Courtois (Belgium),</p>
<p>walkerover (Courtois withdrew before match)</p>
<p>3-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Mariana Diaz-Oliva</p>
<p>(Argentina)</p>
<p>4-6 6-2 4-0 (Diaz-Oliva retired)</p>
<p>Ludmila Richterova (Czech Republic) leads 2-Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania) 7-6 (11-9) 3-2 (play suspended because of rain)</p>
</text>
